  "html.bases.h": "Base balancing",
  "html.bases.p": "A strategic view across crew bases: for each base it compares supply (line crew × monthly block-hour cap) with demand (block hours of the pairings anchored at that base), and computes utilization, inter-base links (a deadhead proxy) and a fleet breakdown. From the gap it derives sizing: which base is short of or has surplus crew, and how many to transfer to level the network's load.",
