  "html.dz.pB": "Flight-level events — cancellations, an aircraft pulled from service, delays — dissolve every pairing that touches them. \"Rebuild (plan B)\" creates a repair instance: the neighbourhood is re-generated by column generation, untouched pairings are frozen with their crew (pins), and the solver re-assigns only the new ones. When some legs cannot be covered inside the narrow neighbourhood, expansion kicks in: adjacent untouched pairings (same aircraft type, a stitch point nearby) are unfrozen in rounds and the columns are rebuilt.",
