  "app.crs.desc.all": "The unified queue of all agents — for triage and the administrator's decisions.",
  "app.crs.desc.feedback": "The Feedback agent reads user suggestions (Help → Suggestions), clusters similar ones and drafts CRs: priority = the number of similar suggestions, effort 1-10. Authors see the status of their suggestions.",
  "app.crs.desc.regulatory": "The Regulatory agent builds a digest of rule changes per instance country (the Country attribute in the registry, INTL = international) and drafts CRs for whatever affects the app.",
  "app.crs.desc.uiux": "The UI/UX ideas agent proposes interface improvements: usability heuristics plus public practices of industrial crew-planning systems.",
  "app.crs.agent.audit": "Audit",
  "app.crs.desc.audit": "An external auditor drops a report (hh_mm_dd_mm_yyyy_audit.md) into the audits directory. The check finds new files (every 10 minutes and on demand); Process builds the breakdown: a summary plus findings (bug/flaw/remark/suggestion) — each becomes a CR in this queue. Implement on Test, then port on sign-off.",
