  "app.crs.desc.catalog": "Template catalog: requests for records and for executor kinds. The owner decides on a request in the catalog service; «Sync with catalog» mirrors that decision into the queue — the CR row keyed by the record is born accepted, there is no second approval here. Solver executors are written by the same agent: the judges are the solver build from the branch, its tests and the live stand.",
