  "tour.gcruns.title": "The Runs section",
  "tour.gcruns.p1": "Runs — the list of computations over task packages: the current run receives the package from CDPM, keeps pairing and rostering attempts with their checks and a passport — what it was computed with and on; any attempt can be replayed from the journal (byte for byte) or afresh.",
  "tour.gcruns.p2": "The base of runs is a tree, not a list: the root is the source documents, the data and the answers to the airline questionnaires, and the branches from it are the runs on the same inputs with other models, solvers and solver parameters. The «Run tree» section of the card shows the path from the root, the neighbouring branches with the «what differs» column, their verdicts, machine time and tokens as a sum; the comparison goes with the reference run by default, and with the previous run or with a neighbour by choice. The reference mark is set only by the owner word after acceptance on Prod. Next to the list of runs stands the «All runs» subsection: the runs of both systems in one list with the same filter — the records COSMOS knows and the runs of the CDPM panel that are not here yet; it only shows.",
